{
    "_comment": "The 'second' Milo on the little island in the Village (pale_world.py, link 'milo'). There from the very first second, reachable only through the Pale World. The ONE fourth-wall break in the game (heavy irony, like Fredbear in FNaF World's Halloween update). Scary voice = black screen + silence. A placeholder for something later - for now only this talk.",
    "partner": "milo",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_island"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        "first"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "first": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_island"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_01",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "Oh. Look at that. You found the stone."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_02",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "Congratulations. I've been standing on this little island since the very first second of the game."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_03",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "Watching you walk in circles. Losing to slimes. Paying a man in a hood for a pistol."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_04",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "Yes, I'm also standing by the fence. Don't think about it too hard. Nobody else does."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "What is this place?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_05",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "This? This is content. Very mysterious, very deep lore. Glitching through walls with a glowing marble. Truly the peak of game design."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_06",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "You were hoping for a reward. A secret boss. An ending, maybe."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_07",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "There's nothing here yet. Somebody still has to make it mean something. Somebody is very busy."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_08",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "So go on. Back through your little stone. Tell everyone you found the island. They'll be thrilled."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_09",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "...Hey! Nice view from here, huh?"
                }
            ]
        },
        "again": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_10",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Nice view, huh?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_11",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "Still not finished. Come back after an update."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_island_12",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "text": "You came all the way back here. For this. Incredible dedication."
                }
            ]
